{"synopsis":"Di dunia ini, ada orang-orang yang disebut Awakeners. Mereka memiliki kekuatan fisik dan kemampuan khusus nan luar biasa. Kannagi Minato, yang setiap hari selalu ditindas, tiba-tiba terjebak dalam situasi hidup dan mati. Saat berada di ujung tanduk, dia mendadak bangkit lagi. Ternyata, di dalam dirinya terdapat roh-roh pahlawan pendiri dunia yang dulu pernah menyelamatkan dunia. Sejak itu, hidupnya berubah drastis.\n\nDari penulis terkenal Etou Shunji, pencipta karya hit “Savior of Divine God Draw Out 0.00000001% To Become the Strongest”!","alternative_title":"나만 최강 초월자 입니다","author":"ETOU Shunji","artist":"3rd Ie, Studio No.9, Fuuwai, TSUCHIDA Kenta","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"41ac80cf-2741-4245-892d-0fc905a11585","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"80f8ed9f-f150-4e6b-b474-ac6527386e9d","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"dd3d8e20-f4f0-49bd-9d82-e58c8f0c8834","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"273a1c4e-6966-4413-8842-e5c851be3de6","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"434de1f0-e0a4-47d0-bf71-0759cc0ab396","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"0973432d-3c82-4884-993b-19127d0dbce5","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"","date":"2026-03-08","released":"2026-03-08"},{"chapter_id":"b24704c7-162d-438b-b97a-0c6b25575c03","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2026-03-02","released":"2026-03-02"},{"chapter_id":"a904c6c2-2845-4549-a624-2db474a56b4f","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2026-03-01","released":"2026-03-01"},{"chapter_id":"8f5b44d5-c2d3-41ca-934c-50ff3f4f8736","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2026-02-28","released":"2026-02-28"},{"chapter_id":"bdad7bcb-3a84-490b-87ee-ea2228b9242a","number":"74","chapt